{
 "schema": "asterro.processes/1",
 "note": "Planetary Process Explorer. status: data = ASTERRO holds an Earth variable that measures the condition behind the process, and the rule is applied to every valid Earth cell; indirect = the rule finds settings that favour the process (climate class, named environment type, terrain and climate thresholds) while the process itself is not observed; no_data = described with the data it would need. Rules run in the browser over the 76,781 valid cells. Text lives in ext.proc.<id>.*.",
